  "description": "A seeded generator engine for table-driven tabletop tools: stable PCG32 randomness, per-field\n      random streams that make one value re-rollable without disturbing its neighbours, JSON\n      translation overlays, provenance and licensing, hand-inked SVG map drawing, and a versioned\n      document envelope for sharing what was generated. Knows nothing about any particular game.",
